---
// Hero. Problem + promise + primary CTA, anchored to waitlist.
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <p class="kicker">Resource Inbox · Workshop build</p>

    <h1 class="hero__title">
      A curated library for the AI resources <em>actually</em> worth opening.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero__lede">
      You paste a URL. You tag it. The system drafts an AI verdict.
      You confirm or refine it, then publish it to your subscribers — building a single,
      queryable hub of <strong>community&#8209;validated</strong> documentation and how&#8209;to
      guidance for any tech or topic.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn" href="#waitlist">
        Join the waitlist
        <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#how-it-works">See how it works</a>
    </div>

    <dl class="hero__meta" aria-label="Status">
      <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Workshop 1 · live on Render</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Deploys</dt><dd>Manual (`render deploys create`)</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Signups</dt><dd>Static placeholder</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-block: var(--gap-6) var(--gap-5);
  }

  .hero__title {
    font-size: var(--fs-display);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin-top: var(--gap-3);
  }

  .hero__title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ember);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero__lede {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-top: var(--gap-3);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .hero__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: var(--gap-4);
  }

  .hero__meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--gap-3);
    margin: var(--gap-5) 0 0;
    padding-top: var(--gap-3);
    border-top: var(--rule-hair);
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .hero__meta div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .hero__meta dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }

  .hero__meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero__meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
